        <h1>Privacy &amp; Policy</h1>
        <p class="prv-hero-sub">
          We are committed to protecting your <strong>personal information</strong> and your right to privacy.
          This policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data.
        </p>

        <!-- Meta badges -->
